WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:02.880
What is the single most important lesson

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:04.800
you've learned about yourself

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.370
as a leader?

00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:08.110
The goal of this experience

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:11.150
was never just to learn new concepts.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:14.070
It was to build new habits.

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:16.670
The final step in leading yourself

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:20.350
is to consciously decide which of these new behaviors

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:24.510
you want to hardwire into your leadership identity,

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:27.130
moving from a temporary practice

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:30.250
to a permanent part of your operating system.

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:33.450
After going through this experience,

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:37.850
a manager realized that his habit of drive-by feedback

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:39.970
was causing anxiety.

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:42.370
His new hardwired habit

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:46.090
became scheduling brief intentional feedback sessions.

00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:49.410
He put it on his calendar every Friday.

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:52.150
It became a part of his system.

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:55.130
Your play is to look through your playbook,

00:00:55.130 --> 00:00:57.570
identify the one new practice

00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:00.370
that has been most impactful for you.

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:03.930
Now, schedule a reoccurring block on your calendar

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:08.010
to ensure it continues to stay in practice.

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:11.250
In three months, the newness of this experience

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:12.810
will have worn off.

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:15.850
What is one system or accountability check

00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:18.390
you can put into place now

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:22.210
to ensure you don't revert to old leadership habits?

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:26.290
Turn to the hardwire your habits drill in your playbook

00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:28.050
to document your commitment

00:01:28.050 --> 00:01:31.030
and set your new accountability system.

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:34.650
Now that you've cemented your own habits,

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:38.170
let's focus on celebrating your player success.

00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:39.970
I'll see you in the next video.
